{
  "id": "PSA.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 25",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "*De David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "À toi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", j'élève mon âme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", en toi j'ai mis ma confiance ; que je ne sois pas confus, que mes ennemis ne triomphent pas de moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Non, aucun de ceux qui s'attendent à toi ne sera confus ; ceux-là seront confus qui agissent perfidement sans cause.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fais-moi connaître tes voies, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! enseigne-moi tes sentiers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fais-moi marcher dans ta vérité, et enseigne-moi, car tu es le",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "de mon salut ; c'est à toi que je m'attends tout le jour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Souviens-toi de ta miséricorde, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", et de ta bonté ; car elles sont de tout temps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne te souviens pas des péchés de ma jeunesse ni de mes transgressions",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; selon ta gratuité souviens-toi de moi à cause de ta bonté, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est bon et droit ; c'est pourquoi il enseignera le chemin aux pécheurs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il fera marcher dans le droit [chemin]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "les débonnaires, et il enseignera sa voie aux débonnaires.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tous les sentiers de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sont gratuité et vérité, pour ceux qui gardent son alliance et ses témoignages.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À cause de ton nom, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu me pardonneras mon iniquité ; car elle est grande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui est l'homme qui craint l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? Il lui enseignera le chemin qu'il doit choisir",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son âme habitera au milieu du bien, et sa semence possédera la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le secret",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est pour ceux qui le craignent, pour leur faire connaître son alliance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mes yeux sont continuellement sur l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.25.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.25.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; car c'est lui qui fera sortir mes pieds du filet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tourne-toi vers moi et use de grâce envers moi, car je suis seul et affligé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les détresses de mon cœur se sont agrandies",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; fais-moi sortir de mes angoisses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Regarde mon affliction et mes peines, et pardonne tous mes péchés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Regarde mes ennemis, car ils sont nombreux, et ils me haïssent d'une haine violente.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.25.19",
